\section*{[846] A VERIFICATION IN REGARD TO THE LINEAR TRANSFORMATION OF THE THETA-FUNCTIONS.}

\noindent [From the \textit{Quarterly Journal of Pure and Applied Mathematics}, vol.~xxi. (1886), pp.~77--84.]

